{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698940/extras/Title-About_Millys_Meadow.png?t=1746033604\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Milly\u2019s Meadow (Demo) is a relaxing idle game that sits on your desktop - resize it and place it anywhere to create the perfect peaceful backdrop for your day. Enjoy the soothing sounds of nature, raking leaves and original lo-fi tunes.\u00a0<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698940/extras/MillysMeadowGif1.gif?t=1746033604\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698940/extras/Title-Demo_Millys_Meadow.png?t=1746033604\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo is a minimal version of the base game - and you're welcome to enjoy it forever as a relaxing desktop companion. Keep it on top or behind your favourite apps so you can check in on Milly anytime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you'd like to unlock customisation for Milly and her meadow, add new activities like Fishing and Farming, or adjust activity durations, check out the full version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3698940?t=1746033604","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698940/4bb71c4eafc95c584d4cee4b8563deb6f647dcc0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746033604","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698940/c59e152e6da716d0a2c27018d7231cd91c99df6b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746033604","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698940/c59e152e6da716d0a2c27018d7231cd91c99df6b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746033604","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698940/extras/Title-About_Millys_Meadow.png?t=1746033604\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Milly\u2019s Meadow (Demo) is a relaxing idle game that sits on your desktop - resize it and place it anywhere to create the perfect peaceful backdrop for your day. Enjoy the soothing sounds of nature, raking leaves and original lo-fi tunes.\u00a0<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698940/extras/MillysMeadowGif1.gif?t=1746033604\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698940/extras/Title-Demo_Millys_Meadow.png?t=1746033604\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo is a minimal version of the base game - and you're welcome to enjoy it forever as a relaxing desktop companion. Keep it on top or behind your favourite apps so you can check in on Milly anytime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you'd like to unlock customisation for Milly and her meadow, add new activities like Fishing and Farming, or adjust activity durations, check out the full version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Diesel Laws"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3063730","name":"Milly's Meadow"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698940/ce17012b1fbf6ffcf1189bf208ef77c6a428f3ee/header.jpg?t=1746033604","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class